message: "If you use these corpora or this pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "Language Policy Discourse in Argentina: Official, Expert and Media Fields"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational pipeline for studying how language policy in Argentina is
  produced, legitimated and contested across institutional, academic and journalistic fields.
  Includes corpus construction code, bibliographic metadata, LDA topic models, temporal and
  polarity analyses, and analytical reports. The institutional and expert fields are complete;
  the media field is in preparation.
